break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にこたえるよ(ミ＾o＾ミ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼  Name :  るんるん  さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎  アンダーライブ中メンバーとご飯行ったりとかはしてたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  川後Pとめっちゃ行ったよ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、でも今度、みんなでお疲れさま会したいねって話してるよ\\(^o^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホントこの期間でより一層絆が深まった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼  Name :  ホッシー☆  さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎  さゆはお母さんの手料理で何が一番好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  うーんいっぱいある(。> <。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中でも、かぼちゃの煮物と茄子の味噌炒めが好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーでも、肉じゃがも好きだし、天ぷらも好きだし..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんの手作りこんにゃくも美味しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月に作る手作りのお餅も美味しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局みんな好き（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼  Name :  ひろぽん  さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎  さゆは、ハンバーグにかけるなら何が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  デミグラスが好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも時々、さっぱりしたお醤油ベースのも作るよっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"b